    freq:"Two-hour gaps are normal here. The trains that matter: OUT 08:11 or 10:19 from Nagiso. BACK from Narai 13:11 (reaches Kiso-Fukushima ~13:35, Nagiso 14:24). BACK from Kiso-Fukushima: Shinano 15:31 → Nagiso 15:55, local 16:00 → 16:44, local 17:07 → 17:49, Shinano 17:31 → 17:55", price:"Nagiso → Narai ¥990; Narai → Kiso-Fukushima ¥590; Kiso-Fukushima → Nagiso ¥590 (+¥660 each if you take the Shinano home). About ¥4,300–5,700 for two",
