        tips:"<b>Two corrections from 17 Aug.</b> It is in <b>Shinjuku ward</b>, not central Shibuya — Nishi-Shinjuku 7-9-15, an 8–10 minute walk from Shinjuku's west side, further out than you would expect. And on Tue–Thu it closes 16:30–18:00, so a mid-afternoon arrival on Thu 1 Oct would find it shut.<br><br>Self-service: take a tray, choose noodles, add your own tempura from the rack, pay at the end. No Japanese needed.",
