    alt:"<b>All public transport (¥680 pp, ~1h, two changes with escalators):</b> Inokashira line 08:46 → Shibuya 08:54 → Yamanote (山手線 内回り, toward Shinagawa) 09:01 → Shinagawa 09:15 → Keikyu 09:25 → Terminal 3 09:46. <b>Bags-friendly public option:</b> Inokashira to Shibuya, then the Airport Limousine BUS from Shibuya Mark City (bus stop 92, the Inokashira exit side) 09:35 → Terminal 3 10:46, ¥1,300, cases in the hold — buy at the counter or online, no changes after that. <b>Full door-to-door taxi</b> (~¥9,000–13,000 + tolls) remains the fallback if the morning is rainy or the bags won — no shame in it.",
    missed:"Keikyu's frequency means a missed train costs 10 minutes. The 08:45 pickup exists so nothing else can go wrong either.",
